2 \cdot 7.5h = 20 \implies 15h = 20 \implies h = \frac{20}{15} = \frac{4}{3}
\]

Thus, the length of the altitude to \(EM\) in \(\triangle GEM\) is \(\boxed{\frac{4}{3}}\).
