\[
\int_{0}^{1} \frac{\sinh(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})) \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu}) \, dt}{\sqrt{\sinh^2(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})) (1 - \nu^2 \cosh^2(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})))}}
\]

**Answer:**  
\[
\int_{0}^{1} \frac{\sinh(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})) \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu}) \, dt}{\sqrt{\sinh^2(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})) (1 - \nu^2 \cosh^2(t \cdot \text{arccosh}(\frac{1}{\nu})))}}
\]

步骤 3: Analyze the function A(ν) = arccosh(1/ν), which is a factor in the expression for f(ν) from Step 2. Is A(ν) an increasing or decreasing function of ν on the interval (0,1)? Calculate its derivative to confirm.
